From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: keep application window focusable for Sugar keys

When the GTK4 shell is fullscreen on X11, focus can remain on the compositor
surface while the overlay is visually active. Mark the application window
focusable and restore focus after presentation so the capture controller gets
physical Sugar function keys.

--- a/src/jarabe/main.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/main.py
@@ -292,2 +292,3 @@
         shell_instance._main_window = Gtk.ApplicationWindow(application=shell_instance)
+        shell_instance._main_window.set_focusable(True)
         shell_instance._main_window.set_title("Sugar")
@@ -344,1 +345,2 @@
         shell_instance._main_window.present()
+        shell_instance._main_window.set_focus(shell_instance._overlay)
